WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.938
"These cars are very fancy!" said Mayor Bloom.

2
00:00:16.938 --> 00:00:20.573
Mayor Bloom was at the Metro City Car Show.

3
00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:23.960
The convention center was filled with cars.

4
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.195
A man in a lab coat stepped onto a stage.

5
00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:31.579
Nearby a car was covered by a white sheet.

6
00:00:31.579 --> 00:00:35.522
"You're about to see my latest invention," said the man.

7
00:00:35.522 --> 00:00:39.146
"It's the most amazing car ever!"

8
00:00:39.146 --> 00:00:41.437
He walked toward the car.

9
00:00:41.438 --> 00:00:44.195
Everyone leaned closer to see.

10
00:00:44.196 --> 00:00:46.195
The man grabbed the sheet.

11
00:00:46.195 --> 00:00:50.020
"Behold . . ." The man yanked off the sheet.

12
00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.792
"The Ultra Car!"

13
00:00:52.792 --> 00:00:56.258
Everybody gasped.

14
00:00:56.258 --> 00:01:01.229
The car had wings, rockets, and lots of fancy gadgets.

15
00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.037
Suddenly the car's engine roared.

16
00:01:04.038 --> 00:01:07.708
Tires screeched, and everyone jumped out of the way.

17
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:15.021
Vroom! The Ultra Car smashed through the glass doors and drove away.

18
00:01:15.022 --> 00:01:17.887
Roxy and her friends were at a city bus stop.

19
00:01:17.888 --> 00:01:20.019
They'd been at the library.

20
00:01:20.019 --> 00:01:22.915
Now they were going home.

21
00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:25.481
Jack looked at a poster.

22
00:01:25.481 --> 00:01:29.289
"I wish we could go to the Metro City Car Show."

23
00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:32.301
"We have to go home," said Roxy.

24
00:01:32.302 --> 00:01:36.275
Jack rolled his eyes. "I didn't mean right now.

25
00:01:36.275 --> 00:01:39.840
I meant soon. It would be cool."

26
00:01:39.841 --> 00:01:42.740
"We should go this weekend," said Terrell.

27
00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.616
"Maybe our parents will take us."

28
00:01:45.616 --> 00:01:49.167
"I'll ask my parents tonight!" said Mara.

29
00:01:49.168 --> 00:01:53.492
"I wonder if there are cars that fly at the show," said Jack.

30
00:01:53.492 --> 00:01:58.865
"Zoom!" He held out his arms and ran in circles.

31
00:01:58.865 --> 00:02:02.679
"A flying car would be awesome," said Terrell.

32
00:02:02.679 --> 00:02:08.312
"I wish I could fly," said Mara. "It would be so much fun!"

33
00:02:08.312 --> 00:02:11.770
Roxy nodded. "It does sound like fun."

34
00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:17.725
"We could fly to the library," said Terrell. "Or to the zoo."

35
00:02:17.725 --> 00:02:20.744
"Or to the car show!" said Jack.

36
00:02:20.744 --> 00:02:23.111
Mara watched a pigeon fly by.

37
00:02:23.111 --> 00:02:29.701
"We could fly anywhere we wanted," she said. "Just like birds."

38
00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:32.639
"I have an idea," said Terrell.

39
00:02:32.639 --> 00:02:36.013
"We can ask Rocket Girl to help us fly!"

40
00:02:36.013 --> 00:02:41.667
Roxy laughed. "I'm sure Rocket Girl is too busy for that."

41
00:02:41.668 --> 00:02:45.373
Terrell frowned. "I guess you're right."

42
00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:50.084
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

43
00:02:50.085 --> 00:02:53.999
She stepped away from her friends and pressed a button on the watch.

44
00:02:53.999 --> 00:02:56.427
Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

45
00:02:56.428 --> 00:03:00.717
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "What's wrong?"

46
00:03:00.717 --> 00:03:04.229
"There's trouble at the car show!" said the mayor.

47
00:03:04.229 --> 00:03:07.239
"Someone has stolen the Ultra Car!

48
00:03:07.239 --> 00:03:10.288
It's the most amazing car ever invented.

49
00:03:10.289 --> 00:03:12.703
And now a thief has it!"

50
00:03:12.703 --> 00:03:15.312
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

51
00:03:15.312 --> 00:03:20.602
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
